<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan FGEP group passes on 54,000T US corn tender.</title>
<headline>Taiwan FGEP group passes on 54,000T US corn tender.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's FGEP group passed on a tender on Wednesday for 54,000 tonnes of U.S. No.2 corn due to high prices, traders said.</p>
</text>
